% how rgs_1_coords.txt was made

reset all
alloc 6000

cyl-rad=.1
load 10.81
double
warp install

mode cb

torus 2 21 400 10 .2
warp along

scale 6
split
split

test clkembed
bfacf load
bfacf target 9999
bfacf search on
bfacf run 1000000

exit

let it run for a while, fiddling with the z-slider, then stop it and do the following:

load |min
centre
trans to lattice
save rgs_1_coords.txt int



